      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f1/Blue_and_White_Cloud_Bridges_%EC%B2%AD%EC%9A%B4%EA%B5%90_%EB%B0%B1%EC%9A%B4%EA%B5%90_%E4%BD%9B%E5%9C%8B%E5%AF%BA_%E9%9D%91%E9%9B%B2%E6%A9%8B_%E7%99%BD%E9%9B%B2%E6%A9%8B_%285281872665%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Blue_and_White_Cloud_Bridges_%EC%B2%AD%EC%9A%B4%EA%B5%90_%EB%B0%B1%EC%9A%B4%EA%B5%90_%E4%BD%9B%E5%9C%8B%E5%AF%BA_%E9%9D%91%E9%9B%B2%E6%A9%8B_%E7%99%BD%E9%9B%B2%E6%A9%8B_(5281872665).jpg",
